OL,3,ADisability benefit review calls for
OL,4,Acloser link with claimant costs
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe government has committed to some of
OL,7,Fits recommendations, including
OL,8,Ffast-track payments for people with
OL,9,Fsevere conditions, but will not respond
OL,10,Ffully to the plans until early next
OL,11,Fyear.
OL,13,FThe Conservatives said the year-long
OL,14,Freview was a "compete farce" and showed
OL,15,Fa "complete absence of substance".
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/38
