OL,3,ALand mine casualties soar in Syria, two
OL,4,Ayears after war
OL,5,
OL,6,FEleven-year-old Alaa was tending her
OL,7,Ffamily's goats with her siblings in a
OL,8,Ffield behind their home in Umm Khuzaym,
OL,9,Fnorth-west Syria, on Sunday when there
OL,10,Fwas a flash and a deafening bang.
OL,12,F"Then we heard people screaming,"
OL,13,FAlaa's father, Walid Mohammed
OL,14,FAl-Ghafar, told the BBC.
OL,16,FWalid ran outside to find his daughter
OL,17,Flying face down, killed, and her
OL,18,F10-year-old brother, Mahmoud, seriously
OL,19,Finjured.
OL,21,FUnwittingly, the children had triggered
OL,22,Fa landmine.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/38
